    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump, Jump, Jump!</h2></strong><br><br>Ever feel like you just need to let loose and jump around? Now's your chance! In this fun and light-hearted platformer, you can unleash your inner wild side, leaping from one spot to another, whether it looks stable or not. Traverse through a series of quirky, one-of-a-kind levels, and aim to reach the top!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206790/extras/35680180b7dee236b168b7370f67c569.poster.avif?t=1727698740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206790/extras/35680180b7dee236b168b7370f67c569.webm?t=1727698740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206790/extras/35680180b7dee236b168b7370f67c569.mp4?t=1727698740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Whether you're a casual gamer looking to unwind or someone who's eager for a challenge, this game has got you covered. With just a well-timed spacebar press, you can easily clear levels. But if you're up for more, the game offers a variety of unique challenges that will test your skills.<br><br>When you hit an unexpected obstacle, just remember: <strong><i>Just Jump!</i></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump, Jump, Jump!</h2></strong><br><br>Ever feel like you just need to let loose and jump around? Now's your chance! In this fun and light-hearted platformer, you can unleash your inner wild side, leaping from one spot to another, whether it looks stable or not. Traverse through a series of quirky, one-of-a-kind levels, and aim to reach the top!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206790/extras/35680180b7dee236b168b7370f67c569.poster.avif?t=1727698740\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206790/extras/35680180b7dee236b168b7370f67c569.webm?t=1727698740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206790/extras/35680180b7dee236b168b7370f67c569.mp4?t=1727698740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Whether you're a casual gamer looking to unwind or someone who's eager for a challenge, this game has got you covered. With just a well-timed spacebar press, you can easily clear levels. But if you're up for more, the game offers a variety of unique challenges that will test your skills.<br><br>When you hit an unexpected obstacle, just remember: <strong><i>Just Jump!</i></strong>",
